{"seq":1,"slug":"module-federation","title":"Module Federation 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/federation-and-composition/module-federation","wordCount":726,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"module-federation-实践\">Module Federation 实践</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Module Federation 是 Webpack 5 引入的运行时模块共享机制，让独立构建的应用可以在运行时动态加载彼此的模块——无需重新编译消费方。2024 年发布的 Module Federation 2.0 在 2025-2026 年达到生产稳定，增加了 TypeScript 类型自动共享、跨构建工具的统一运行时、manifest 协议和 Side Effect Scanner。<code>@module-federation/enhanced</code> 包支持 Webpack、Rspack、Vite 三大构建工具，其中 Rspack + MF2 组合以 5-10 倍的构建速度提升成为当前最佳实践方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"module-federation-2-0-核心升级\">Module Federation 2.0 核心升级</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;MF 1.0 Pain Points&quot;&#10;        P1[&quot;No TypeScript support across remotes&quot;]&#10;        P2[&quot;Webpack-only, no Vite/Rspack&quot;]&#10;        P3[&quot;Manual version negotiation&quot;]&#10;        P4[&quot;No runtime dependency visibility&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;MF 2.0 Solutions&quot;&#10;        S1[&quot;Dynamic TypeScript type hints (dts: true)&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;Unified runtime across bundlers&quot;]&#10;        S3[&quot;mf-manifest.json protocol&quot;]&#10;        S4[&quot;Chrome DevTools + Side Effect Scanner&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    P1 --&gt; S1&#10;    P2 --&gt; S2&#10;    P3 --&gt; S3&#10;    P4 --&gt; S4\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"MF 1.0 Pain Points\"\n        P1[\"No TypeScript support across remotes\"]\n        P2[\"Webpack-only, no Vite/Rspack\"]\n        P3[\"Manual version negotiation\"]\n        P4[\"No runtime dependency visibility\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"MF 2.0 Solutions\"\n        S1[\"Dynamic TypeScript type hints (dts: true)\"]\n        S2[\"Unified runtime across bundlers\"]\n        S3[\"mf-manifest.json protocol\"]\n        S4[\"Chrome DevTools + Side Effect Scanner\"]\n    end\n    P1 --&gt; S1\n    P2 --&gt; S2\n    P3 --&gt; S3\n    P4 --&gt; S4</pre><p><strong>TypeScript 类型共享</strong>：MF 2.0 在构建时自动为暴露的模块生成 <code>.d.ts</code> 文件，消费方在开发时自动获得类型提示，类似 <code>npm link</code> 的体验。</p>\n<p><strong>统一运行时</strong>：将 Module Federation 的运行时逻辑从 Webpack 中解耦，形成独立的 runtime 层。这让 Rspack、Vite 也能支持 MF，且跨构建工具的应用可以互相消费。</p>\n<p><strong>manifest 协议</strong>：<code>mf-manifest.json</code> 取代了硬编码的 <code>remoteEntry.js</code> URL，支持版本发现、预加载声明和部署平台集成。</p>\n<h3 id=\"host-与-remote-模型\">Host 与 Remote 模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Remote 应用 - 暴露模块供其他应用使用&#10;// product-app/rspack.config.ts&#10;import { ModuleFederationPlugin } from &#39;@module-federation/enhanced/rspack&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default {&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    new ModuleFederationPlugin({&#10;      name: &#39;product&#39;,&#10;      filename: &#39;remoteEntry.js&#39;,&#10;      exposes: {&#10;        &#39;./ProductList&#39;: &#39;./src/components/ProductList&#39;,&#10;        &#39;./ProductDetail&#39;: &#39;./src/components/ProductDetail&#39;,&#10;        &#39;./useProduct&#39;: &#39;./src/hooks/useProduct&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;      shared: {&#10;        react: { singleton: true, requiredVersion: &#39;^19.0.0&#39; },&#10;        &#39;react-dom&#39;: { singleton: true, requiredVersion: &#39;^19.0.0&#39; },&#10;      },&#10;      // MF 2.0: 自动生成类型&#10;      dts: true,&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;};&#10;&#10;// Host 应用 - 消费远程模块&#10;// shell-app/rspack.config.ts&#10;import { ModuleFederationPlugin } from &#39;@module-federation/enhanced/rspack&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default {&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    new ModuleFederationPlugin({&#10;      name: &#39;shell&#39;,&#10;      remotes: {&#10;        product: &#39;product@http://localhost:3001/mf-manifest.json&#39;,&#10;        cart: &#39;cart@http://localhost:3002/mf-manifest.json&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;      shared: {&#10;        react: { singleton: true, requiredVersion: &#39;^19.0.0&#39; },&#10;        &#39;react-dom&#39;: { singleton: true, requiredVersion: &#39;^19.0.0&#39; },&#10;        &#39;@tanstack/react-query&#39;: { singleton: true },&#10;      },&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Remote 应用 - 暴露模块供其他应用使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// product-app/rspack.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ModuleFederationPlugin } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@module-federation/enhanced/rspack'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModuleFederationPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      filename: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'remoteEntry.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      exposes: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        './ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/components/ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        './ProductDetail'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/components/ProductDetail'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        './useProduct'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/hooks/useProduct'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      shared: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        react: { singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, requiredVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^19.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'react-dom'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, requiredVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"